# Client Identification

## Target

The target client for this preservation project is:

- Product: Roblox WindowsPlayer
- Client version: `0.472.0.419960`
- Deployment identifier: `version-0137f7d4848f436a`
- Deployment date: March 26, 2021
- Main executable: `RobloxPlayerBeta.exe`

The target was identified by comparing Roblox deployment history with the date of the historical Desktop Beta footage.

The next WindowsPlayer deployment after this build was `0.473.0.420291`, deployed on April 7, 2021. This means `0.472.0.419960` was the current production WindowsPlayer during the April 4, 2021 SharkBlox video.

## Historical Desktop Beta

The historical Desktop Beta experience is shown here:

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hn0i0Fufm_Q

The client could enter the desktop app experience using the old app launch mode associated with:

`LaunchExp:InApp`

The preservation project is specifically interested in the signup and onboarding interface shown during this period, including the avatar selection flow.

